        "tree_id": "0a912eadad46a1608d1600037b91717f81b1e22b",
        "message": "0.10.4: merge upstream display stack to fix tiny/shrunk picture\n\nMerge upstream QITOU v0.18.0 display path:\n- AaCompositor: top-left to GL bottom-left Y-flip viewport fix\n  (upstream v0.11.7 'fix blank top on bike screen')\n- aa/VideoDecoder: use SPS crop-rect for real content size instead of\n  KEY_WIDTH/KEY_HEIGHT (our 480x1280 portrait stream reported wrong)\n- ScreenViewport.computeScreenViewport: testable unified geometry\n- VehicleDisplayProfile: CanvasInsets safe areas, DisplayScaleMode,\n  CarlifeSourceResolutions, per-vehicle SharedPreferences profile\n- MiniVideoPipeline: encoder candidate fallback policy (CodecCandidatePolicy /\n  VideoCodecPolicy), setBikePreview canvas diagnostics\n- QrScanActivity: pinch/keys zoom, tap-to-focus+metering, QR-only scanning\n\nLocal adaptations kept:\n- 450MT bike canvas 800x384 with CanvasInsets(bottom=80) gauge safe area\n- MiniVideoPipeline.streamWidth/streamHeight/decoderInputSurface accessors\n  for MiniActivity/ControlActivity touch mapping\n- MiniState exportLog ZIP name keeps timestamp (QITOU-support-<stamp>.zip)",
