        "message": "0.10.3: fix MotoPlay discovery + dynamic video sizing\n\n- MotoLink: resolve bike address from route gateway/DHCP/.1/.254 candidates\n  plus /24 subnet scan on 10930 (fixes bike=0.0.0.0 probe failure)\n- Wire SPS onVideoSize -> pipeline.updateSourceSize so compositor/preview/\n  touch mapping follow actual stream orientation (fixes torn/garbled frames)\n- AaCompositor: setFit() for source orientation changes; updateCaptureSize\n  redraws even before canvas is set\n- ControlActivity/MiniActivity: read real surface/view size instead of\n  hardcoded 1280x720; dynamic touch mapping and fps label\n- MiniState.exportLog: timestamped log filename QITOU-support-<ts>.log",
